# Bestial Bloodline: "{4}{G}: Return this card from your graveyard to your hand." Bot1 puts the Aura on its Ornithopter (a 0/2 becomes
# a 2/4). Bot2's Disenchant destroys the Aura on turn 2 (the Ornithopter is a 0/2 again). On turn 3 Bot1 has four sources, Mox Emerald
# (the {G}) among them, tapped: the ability is refused for one short of {4}{G}. A Plains played then makes the fifth mana, which pays it
# exactly (the pool is empty afterwards) and the card goes to Bot1's hand from the graveyard.

